   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Paying and fixing",
     "texto": [
      "You pay the **alquiler** to the **casero**, or the instalments of the **hipoteca** to the bank. Every month the **recibos** arrive: electricity, water and gas. In a building with neighbours you also pay the **comunidad**.\n\nIf an appliance fails, we say **se ha estropeado** or that there is an **avería**: se ha estropeado la **lavadora**. To use it you must **enchufar** and **encender**. A **gotera** is water falling through the ceiling.\n\nTo ask someone to **arreglar** it, you call the **fontanero** and say: **necesito que venga**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "gramatica",
     "titulo": "Asking with «que» + subjunctive",
     "texto": [
      "To ask another person for something, we use a verb of wish or need + **que** + **subjunctive**:\n\n- **Necesito que venga** un fontanero.\n- **Quiero que lo arreglen** hoy.\n- **Espero que no tarde.**\n\nTo say the purpose of an action: **para que** + subjunctive:\n\n- Mando al fontanero **para que lo arregle**.\n\nIf the subject is the same, «que» is not needed and the infinitive is used: **Necesito arreglarlo** hoy."
     ],
